  dialogueLines:
  - _characterIcon: {fileID: -8625906013721215279, guid: e8aef95697aea1b488e16f474f46c216, type: 3}
    line: '[TACTIC SUBVERTED]'
  - _characterIcon: {fileID: -8625906013721215279, guid: e8aef95697aea1b488e16f474f46c216, type: 3}
    line: My database does not contain any plausible explanation on the event that
      just occurred.
  - _characterIcon: {fileID: -8625906013721215279, guid: e8aef95697aea1b488e16f474f46c216, type: 3}
    line: 'Proceeding forward, data drawn from ''The Art of War'' indicates that
      the best defence is a good offense. '
  - _characterIcon: {fileID: -3607883123437360786, guid: 3ac0368c78cff2048958d9e1d88a407b, type: 3}
    line: Oh, I saw that book trending in the red-pill male section. Dunno what that
      quote means though.
  - _characterIcon: {fileID: -3607883123437360786, guid: 3ac0368c78cff2048958d9e1d88a407b, type: 3}
    line: Probably a good sign to read through every line of my code though.
